module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.live_argument_threaded_past_the_arm_that_decides

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data live_argument_threaded_past_the_arm_that_decides: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "live_argument_threaded_past_the_arm_that_decides" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**a live argument threaded past the arm that actually decides the verdict** (INVALID STATE: a check is named and cited as LIVE because one of its arguments is read from the real tree, while the predicate it asserts is already settled by a different, hand-authored argument that the live one cannot influence -- so the live input is threaded into a call whose answer does not depend on it. HARM: the row is permanently green with respect to the tree it claims to observe, and its name is what a reader consults when asking whether the class is covered live, which is exactly the decoration DESIGN section 4b calls worse than absent because it will be cited as coverage. It also BUYS THE COST OF LIVENESS WITHOUT THE SIGNAL -- the live producer here is a whole-tree fill -- so the row looks expensive enough to be doing something. DISTINGUISHING FACT, and it is what separates this from an ordinary weak assertion: THE DECIDING ARM AND THE LIVE ARM ARE DISJOINT INPUTS TO ONE TOTAL FUNCTION, so nothing at the call site looks wrong; every argument is well-typed, the live producer is genuinely called, and the fixture argument is genuinely a fixture. The tell is structural and mechanical -- find the arm that can produce the asserted outcome ALONE, and ask whether the live argument is an input to it. SPECIMEN, gunbc 2026-09-03: v2.test.claim.long.effect_reach_test effect_reach_live_03_normalize_witness_derived_host_reading_holds asserted v2.lens.effect_reach derived_host_reading over effect_reach_classification_from_facts with decls bound to v2.std.fn_index fn_arrow_decl_facts_live and data_inits bound to a hand-authored one-element live_03_normalize_data_inits. In that function the data-init arm closure_data_init_path_flows consumes only closure_modules and data_inits: a path-shaped literal_fp in any closure module yields a GunbcCompileEntrySink flow with no reachability and no decls, and any non-empty flow list is HostEffectReach, hence derived_host_reading. The module also carried an annotation asserting that this row LEGITIMATELY READS the live producer, so the false claim was stated in prose beside the code that falsified it. DISCRIMINATING RED AND POSITIVE CONTROL, BOTH EXECUTED rather than argued, via claim_batch on the lens: substituting decls to the EMPTY list while holding the hand data_inits fixed leaves derived_host_reading TRUE -- the live argument is non-discriminating; and holding the LIVE decls while substituting data_inits to EMPTY yields derived_host_reading FALSE with effect_reach_flow_count 0 -- the live scan contributes ZERO flows from this entry, so the row had no live content at all rather than merely a weak one. The unmodified row PASSES, which is the positive control that the harness and the lens were both working. THE PAIR IS THE METHOD AND NOT AN INCIDENT OF THIS SPECIMEN: neither substitution alone decides the question, because a passing empty-decls arm is consistent with the live arm merely being redundant, and only the second substitution shows it was empty. ",
    "RESOLUTION AND WHY IT IS A DELETION: the row was removed rather than renamed, because its deciding arm was already enrolled over the identical literal_fp as effect_reach_path_data_init_derived_host_reading_holds in the same module, so a rename would have kept a DESIGN section 2 duplicate spelled with real module names; and no live row is authorable on that lens today, since its closure comes from ModuleImportFact, which v2.lens.live_read_classification g2_live_production_boundary_law declares FIXTURE-FACING with no live producer in the corpus. THE SHAPE OF THE MISTAKE IS AUTHORABLE BEFORE THE PRODUCER EXISTS, which is why the name of the missing producer is the trigger and not the excuse. ",
    "RUNG FOUND AT: 1, mitigatable -- nothing silent is produced, the row simply asserts less than its name, and the only thing containing the harm is that a reader may read the call. CEILING: 2, mechanically preventable. The question -- does the asserted outcome change when this argument is replaced by its type identity or an empty value -- is decidable by EXECUTION per argument and is exactly the coverage-is-per-argument grain, but it is not derivable from the call shape alone, because whether an argument is influential depends on the callee body over the actual fixture values. Not higher: a caller may pass any well-typed value to any parameter and forbidding a non-influential argument would forbid ordinary total functions, so the invalid state stays writable. ",
    "NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, named as the capability and covering BOTH directions: a per-argument influence check that, for each argument of an enrolled witness call, re-executes the witness with that argument substituted and refuses when the verdict is unchanged for an argument the row NAMES -- sufficient for reddening both a non-discriminating live argument and a row whose live arm contributes nothing, since the specimen needed both substitutions to be characterised. A convention that live rows must be named live would be satisfied while the capability stayed dead. ",
    "BOUNDARY against neighbouring classes: check_subject_narrower_than_its_declared_claim is about a subject that is a strict subset of what the row claims to range over, and the repair there is widening the subject; here the subject is right and one INPUT is inert, and the repair is either removing the inert input or supplying the producer the name promises. It is likewise not incidental_denominator_as_wall, which is about the wall being computed over the wrong population. ",
    "AND IT IS SHARPER THAN THE ASSERTED-NOT-PRODUCED SHAPE IT MOST RESEMBLES, which is the reason it is filed rather than folded in: there the producer is IMPORTED AND UNCALLED, so the tell is visible at the call site -- a hand-built value stands where a produced one should. HERE THE PRODUCER IS GENUINELY CALLED and its result is genuinely passed, and what fails is REACHABILITY INSIDE THE CALLEE, so no reading of the call site can see it and the tell is only recoverable from the callee's arm structure or from substitution. THE GENERAL FORM IS WORTH MORE THAN ANY ONE ROW: a verdict DISJOINED over a live arm and a fixture arm silently becomes the fixture arm, and nothing goes red, because the disjunction is satisfied before the live arm is consulted. ",
    "BOUNDARY against the three adjacent roster rows, none of which is this: absorbing_fallback is a FAILURE arm that widens instead of refusing, and here no arm fails at all -- the wrong answer is a TRUE one reached without the input it names; empty_observation_narrow is a CENSUS whose population is narrower than its claim, where the subject is the defect, while here the subject is right and one input is inert; and predicate_vacuously_true_on_an_empty_domain is green because its domain is EMPTY, whereas this predicate ranges over a perfectly non-empty fixture domain and is simply not a function of the argument the row is named for. The repairs are disjoint in all three directions, which is DESIGN section 4b's keying-on-the-repair test.)",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
